 blend of petulance and arrogance I&amp;#39;ve come to expect from tax-feeders. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/4306382232546893453'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/4306382232546893453'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html?showComment=1398615966745#c4306382232546893453' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='18' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-bAwUsWSNJqY/Ut1X_S7xqyI/AAAAAAAAKBs/c-w-CbO5t1c/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575887856060602825' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575887856060602825' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 27, 2014 at 10:26 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-806374347110554366</id><published>2014-04-27T07:15:33.067-06:00</published><updated>2014-04-27T07:15:33.067-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Why don&amp;#39;t you get a job, Willy? Think of it - ...</title><content type='html'>Why don&amp;#39;t you get a job, Willy? Think of it - you could be a productive member of society, rather than the miserable freeloader you are. &lt;br /&gt;No, you&amp;#39;d rather file for SSI as a psychiatric disability, I&amp;#39;d guess. Typical sovcit loser.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/806374347110554366'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/806374347110554366'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html?showComment=1398604533067#c806374347110554366' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575887856060602825' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575887856060602825' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1021628184"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 27, 2014 at 7:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7609706768742214029</id><published>2014-02-26T12:47:06.015-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-26T12:47:06.015-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The time is drawing near when cops will be the hun...</title><content type='html'>The time is drawing near when cops will be the hunted and considered &amp;quot;open season&amp;quot; year &amp;#39;round. The American public&amp;#39;s need to &amp;quot;bear arms&amp;quot; to resist tyranny has become more and more obvious. Cops are nothing but thug-criminals with a shiny badge. While some might argue that not all cops are bad, all cops submit to organized crime that is supported and encouraged by the illegal and criminal &amp;quot;system&amp;quot; we used to call justice. Therefore every cop is, at the minimum, complicit and thus, guilty!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/7609706768742214029'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/7609706768742214029'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html?showComment=1393444026015#c7609706768742214029' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575887856060602825' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575887856060602825' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1989401435"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2014 at 12:47 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4614569840338663367</id><published>2014-02-26T10:23:21.589-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-26T10:23:21.589-07:00</updated><title type='text'>up to 29 months&#xa;&#xa;http://m.kxly.com/news/colville-p...</title><content type='html'>up to 29 months&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://m.kxly.com/news/colville-police-officer-pleads-guilty-to-felony-charges/-/23244846/24669000/-/22e1b4z/-/index.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/4614569840338663367'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/4614569840338663367'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html?showComment=1393435401589#c4614569840338663367' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575887856060602825' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575887856060602825' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-391011429"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2014 at 10:23 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3292479159987226997</id><published>2014-02-26T08:09:41.598-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-26T08:09:41.598-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I for one feel safer knowing that these skinny, bl...</title><content type='html'>I for one feel safer knowing that these skinny, blonde, jogging females are being removed from the streets. I can sleep better at night knowing that the police are keeping these horrible criminals away from me. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Next they should target those hardened criminals who loiter, street preachers,  and little old ladies who drive too slow. We must clean up the streets.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/3292479159987226997'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/3292479159987226997'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html?showComment=1393427381598#c3292479159987226997' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575887856060602825' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575887856060602825' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1290689997"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2014 at 8:09 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4001652925051535363</id><published>2014-02-26T05:21:12.255-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-26T05:21:12.255-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I hope that some lawyer can put the arm on Austin ...</title><content type='html'>I hope that some lawyer can put the arm on Austin Police for a fat payout. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Most people in Austin would consider this way too extreme, but, guest what? They&amp;#39;ll continue to elect the same jackasses who make this cop malpractice possible.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Travis County in which Austin is located is where the Deputy Constable tasered a 70 year old woman over refusing to sign a traffic ticket. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The Deputy was a young man who looked like he could have played line-backer for the Longhorns.  Yet he couldn&amp;#39;t handle a 70 year old woman. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The county regs prohibit tasers on the very young and very old. If the woman had pulled a gun and killed the deputy I&amp;#39;d say that was self defense.  I would have &amp;quot;no-billed&amp;quot; on grand jury.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Yet, the stupid county voters put the chief constable back in office the next election instead firing him.  What can you do?  The county paid out $20000 in damages to the woman.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As a reminder to cops, remember the Claude Dallas incident many years ago in Idaho where Claude killed a notorious badge heavy fish cop and his assistant. The jury came close to ruling justifiable homicide.  Claude ended up serving about ten years on manslaughter in think.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/4001652925051535363'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/4001652925051535363'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html?showComment=1393417272255#c4001652925051535363' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575887856060602825' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575887856060602825' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2034347017"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2014 at 5:21 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4902692811236882406</id><published>2014-02-25T20:52:51.708-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-25T20:52:51.708-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, I love your blog and your comments, but you ...</title><content type='html'>Will, I love your blog and your comments, but you should &lt;b&gt;stop&lt;/b&gt; calling these thugs &amp;quot;well-nourished&amp;quot;/&amp;quot;well-fed&amp;quot;. They&amp;#39;re more accurately described as overfed since all of them seem to have weight issues arousing from the excessive comsumption of sugary treats and little exercise, aside from ganging up on the public that foots the bill for their gluttony.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/4902692811236882406'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/4902692811236882406'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html?showComment=1393386771708#c4902692811236882406' title=''/><author><name>Incitatus</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07755304957861054440</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575887856060602825' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575887856060602825' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-486996754"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 25, 2014 at 8:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3184432048281961541</id><published>2014-02-24T15:57:27.770-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-24T15:57:27.770-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;m sorry for the financial dire straits you a...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;m sorry for the financial dire straits you and yours are experiencing. Were I not in a similar situation myself I&amp;#39;d again send you cash, Will. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I think this quote from PDX&amp;#39;s bureau&amp;#39;s union boss goes well with your current article focusing on Austin&amp;#39;s nutcase:  http://www.oregonlive.com/portland/index.ssf/2014/02/portland_police_union_presiden_7.html&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thank you for your continued work on behalf of us all. It is noble. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Kevin</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/3184432048281961541'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575887856060602825/comments/default/3184432048281961541'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html?showComment=1393282647770#c3184432048281961541' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/the-art-acevedo-defense-at-least-my.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575887856060602825' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575887856060602825' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-55161175"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 24, 2014 at 3:57 PM"/></entry></feed>